        "text": "As the AI model, I don't have a built-in command to save the chat history directly.\n\nThe most straightforward way is to use your terminal's features:\n\n1.  **Scroll up** through our conversation.\n2.  **Select the text** you want to save.\n3.  **Copy and paste** it into a text editor and save the file.\n\nThe Gemini CLI application itself might also have a feature for exporting chats or may save them to a log file, but the copy-paste method is the most direct and universal way."
      }
